        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Slim Wall Mount Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 3-1/4\" length slim wall mount door stop features a wide 2\" diameter mounting base for better load distribution and stability, plus  concealed mounting screws for clean looks. For use in residential and commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-BDS725S-size.gif?v=1704354625\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-BDS725S-630 Slim Wall Mount Door Stop Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEasy to install with the included (4) plastic anchors and (4) #6 x 1\" screws. Can be mounted to walls, baseboards or doors. Concealed mounting base is made from zinc plated steel and all exposed metal parts are 304 stainless steel with a satin finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD-BDS725S-630 Slim Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-1/4\" (82 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 2\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Shaft Diameter: 3/8\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip: Black</li>\r\n<li>Exposed Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
